<title>BELGIUM: French franc not discussed at EU meeting.</title>
<headline>French franc not discussed at EU meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French franc has not been discussed at a meeting of EU finance ministers in Brussels on Sunday, a European Commission spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been no discussion of the French franc,&quot; spokesman Patrick Child told reporters.</p>
<p>The special session was convened to discuss the Italian lira's entry to the European Union's Exchange Rate Mechanism after central bank and treasury officials failed on Saturday to agree a central rate for the lira in the grid. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
